"matching subsequences.  Previously, the algorithm would occasionally break a"
" block of matching elements into two list entries. (Enhancement by Tim "
"Peters.)"
msgstr ""
":mod:`difflib` 模块中的 :meth:`SequenceMatcher.get_matching_blocks` "
